WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.859
Welcome to Module 3 of Global Secure
Access as the Identity-Aware Network:

2
00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:08.013
the compliant network
and tenant restrictions.

3
00:00:08.013 --> 00:00:12.442
These are the two signals only Microsoft
Entra can produce from the network,

4
00:00:12.442 --> 00:00:16.662
and both come with the Microsoft
traffic profile you enabled in Module 2.

5
00:00:16.662 --> 00:00:21.204
Both can lock people out, so this module
teaches their failure modes first,

6
00:00:21.204 --> 00:00:25.075
and runs them in report-only or
a pilot before they block anyone.

7
00:00:25.075 --> 00:00:30.028
It covers Steps 7 and 8 of the Global
Secure Access implementation guide,

8
00:00:30.028 --> 00:00:34.700
and takes about forty-five minutes,
plus a lab in your own test tenant.
